Place your service account JSON here as `sa.json`.

Get it from Google Cloud Console:
  APIs & Services → Credentials → Create credentials → Service account
  → open the account → Keys → Add key → Create new key → JSON.

Then share your Google Sheet with the service account's `client_email`
(Editor access) so the server can read and write rows.

This file is committed only to keep the folder; `sa.json` itself is gitignored.
